      "scope": "Two actual source-after-slots results: scalar losses and physical/energy mesh slots with any positive total are chosen before all arithmetic sources; after any positive caller detector parameter e and seed prime set, an actual source S with SourceExclusions and FirstTail(4*e) is constructed. Product ideal/subgroup then precede native degree/J/common height, outer character, its constant/threshold and all smaller heights/matching batches/nonempty fibers. The detector e is separate from the native epsilonE loss. Complete HighData/SourceData and the other three Moments fields remain pending.",
